<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Starlight High School Debate Tournament 2025</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f9f9ff;
      margin: 20px;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #2c2c54;
      text-align: center;
      border: 3px solid #2c2c54;
      padding: 12px;
      background-color: #dcdcff;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #3c3c80;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
    p {
      margin: 10px 0;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    table {
      width: 80%;
      margin: 20px auto;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }
    table, th, td {
      border: 1px solid #2c2c54;
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .contact {
      border: 2px dashed #3c3c80;
      padding: 15px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      background-color: #f0f0ff;
    }
    form {
      margin-top: 15px;
    }
    input, textarea {
      margin: 5px 0;
      padding: 8px;
      width: 95%;
      border: 1px solid #3c3c80;
    }
    button {
      background-color: #3c3c80;
      color: white;
      padding: 10px;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    button:hover {
      background-color: #5a5ad1;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Starlight High School Debate Tournament 2025</h1>

  <h2>📍 Event Details</h2>
  <p>Join us for the Annual Debate Tournament 2025 hosted by Starlight High School!  
  This year’s theme is <b>“Voices of Tomorrow.”</b>  
  Students will showcase their public speaking and critical thinking skills.</p>

  <table>
    <tr>
      <th>Date</th>
      <th>Time</th>
      <th>Venue</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>October 15, 2025</td>
      <td>9:00 AM – 4:00 PM</td>
      <td>Starlight High Auditorium</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h2>🎉 Who’s Invited?</h2>
  <p>All students, teachers, parents and alumni are invited.</p>


  <h2>📞 Contact Information</h2>
  <div class="contact">
    <p>For inquiries, reach us at:</p>
    <p><b>Email:</b> debateclub@starlighthigh.edu</p>
    <p><b>Phone:</b> +123-456-7890</p>
  </div>

  <h2>📝 RSVP Form</h2>
  <form>
    <label for="name">Full Name:</label><br>
    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Enter your name"><br>

    <label for="email">Email Address:</label><br>
    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email"><br>

    <label for="message">Message / Special Requests:</label><br>
    <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Write here..."></textarea><br>

    <button type="submit">Submit RSVP</button>
  </form>

</body>
</html>
